# The testing house stays on this machine, in every repo (decided 2026-11-13).
# bin/prepublish refuses a push that carries it.
.administration/

# The vector is the single source of truth and the only icon artifact in git.
# `npm run icon` rebuilds the png, the iconset (every size rendered from the
# vector) and the icns from it, and the release workflow runs that per platform
# before packaging: mac gets the icns from iconutil, linux and windows get the
# png. Nothing here is committed that a build can produce.
build/icon.png
build/icon.icns
build/icon.iconset/
build/icon.ico
